   "type": "text",
   "x": 1428.7,
   "y": 504,
   "width": 390.0,
   "height": 112.5,
   "text": "docs/product/README.md groups these by flow \u2014 Queue,\nPull requests, Reports, Adoption. This screen groups\nby what a person is acting on, because \"pull\nrequests\" names the mechanism rather than the goal.\nTwo groupings of one set is a fork: whichever wins,\nboth files say it.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "docs/product/README.md groups these by flow \u2014 Queue,\nPull requests, Reports, Adoption. This screen groups\nby what a person is acting on, because \"pull\nrequests\" names the mechanism rather than the goal.\nTwo groupings of one set is a fork: whichever wins,\nboth files say it.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
