   "type": "text",
   "x": 1428.7,
   "y": 864,
   "width": 382.5,
   "height": 75.0,
   "text": "One string per command, already printed by --help.\nToday those summaries run to 85 characters and will\nnot fit a menu row; shortening them fixes the menu\nand the help in one move.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "One string per command, already printed by --help.\nToday those summaries run to 85 characters and will\nnot fit a menu row; shortening them fixes the menu\nand the help in one move.",
