   "originalText": "No tag has been cut. A source build prints the Go\npseudo-version v0.0.0-20260907003604-8470a17833e7 \u2014\n38 characters, which will not sit in this header\nbeside anything else. The header needs a short form:\nthe tag where one exists, the commit where none\ndoes.",
