   "x": 595.5,
   "y": 820.0,
   "width": 528.0,
   "height": 100.0,
   "text": "update, uninstall, init and report ask unconditionally, in the\nCLI's own words. take, author, finish and amend ask only where the\nconduct flags withhold the act. list, status and doctor change\nnothing and ask nothing. The screen adds no gate of its own \u2014 it\ndispatches, and the command it named asks.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "update, uninstall, init and report ask unconditionally, in the\nCLI's own words. take, author, finish and amend ask only where the\nconduct flags withhold the act. list, status and doctor change\nnothing and ask nothing. The screen adds no gate of its own \u2014 it\ndispatches, and the command it named asks.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
